Package: objtools
Version: 1.10
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kyle Wickens
Depends: libssl-dev, zlib1g-dev, libfuzzy-dev, binutils-dev, liblzma-dev, libbz2-dev, liblz4-dev, liblzma5, liblzo2-dev, libucl-dev
Homepage: https://github.com/z0mb13w4r/objtools
Description: objtools
 These tools were originally designed to be a research project
 and drop-in replacement for readelf, objcopy and objdump utilising
 Capstone disassembly framework. The project then started to grow
 to become a collection of tools for malware and binary analysis.
